cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the C++ Mastery Hub analysis engine or its evaluation corpus in academic work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "C++ Mastery Hub: a dependency-free C++ analysis engine and learning platform"
authors:
  - family-names: Praveen
    given-names: Satvik
    email: satvikpraveen707@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/SatvikPraveen/Cpp-Mastery-Hub"
