license: MIT
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-03
keywords:
  - C++
  - static analysis
  - software metrics
  - cyclomatic complexity
  - Halstead
  - maintainability index
  - memory layout
  - programming education
abstract: >-
  C++ Mastery Hub pairs an interactive learning platform with a self-contained C++20 analysis
  engine. The engine provides a total tokenizer, classical software metrics with documented
  formulas (McCabe, Halstead, Maintainability Index), a rule engine whose diagnostics cite the
  C++ Core Guidelines, CERT and CWE, and a struct memory-layout model with a provably
  padding-minimal field reordering. The repository includes a seeded evaluation corpus and a
  reproducible evaluation script.
